   "subject": "Difference between sem() and lavaan()",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div>Hello, <br></div><div><br></div><div>I am new to Structural Equation Modelling and I have problems to understand the difference between the lavaan() and the sem() functions. I have been reading the tutorials but could not find the answer there as they mainly explain sem() and cfa(). <br></div><div><br></div><div>The reason why I am asking is that I have a model, which has some categorical variables, and the sem()-function is unable to obtain std. errors for the estimates (NA). The lavaan()-function however, is able to compute those. <br></div><div><br></div><div>Under which circumstances would one use the lavaan()- or the sem()-function?</div><div><br></div><div>Would appreciate any explanations and pointers to literature. <br></div><div>Thank you very much for your help!</div><div><br></div><div><br></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "wHUqQur-AwAJ",
   "from": "car...@web.de",
   "author": "5abdb409f213d464",
   "date": "2020-11-04T09:26:48Z",
   "subject": "Re: Difference between sem() and lavaan()",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div style=\"line-height:1;padding:0.5em\">The sem and cfa functions are wrappers for the sem function. This means, that some arguments have a certain default setting which are passed to the sem function: <a href=\"https://www.rdocumentation.org/packages/lavaan/versions/0.6-7/topics/sem\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.rdocumentation.org/packages/lavaan/versions/0.6-7/topics/sem&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792420321233000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2sYJ0ih5Jtb1mfkmgeu7CW\">https://www.rdocumentation.org/packages/lavaan/versions/0.6-7/topics/sem</a><br><br>&quot;The sem function is a wrapper for the more general lavaan function, but setting the following default options: <a href=\"http://int.ov.free\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://int.ov.free&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792420321233000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3Ehewzo4bxjRHM5V9T-jRH\">int.ov.free</a> = TRUE, <a href=\"http://int.lv.free\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://int.lv.free&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792420321233000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2cwiib5sw8kCty66ND2XJe\">int.lv.free</a> = FALSE, <a href=\"http://auto.fix.first\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://auto.fix.first&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792420321233000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2KCXL1NbRnZM6LswDZK-Do\">auto.fix.first</a> = TRUE (unless <a href=\"http://std.lv\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://std.lv&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792420321233000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1d1JcYTX9u6DbS1ncGXLYe\">std.lv</a> = TRUE), <a href=\"http://auto.fix.single\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://auto.fix.single&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792420321233000&amp;usg=AOvVaw109TKODbFFklD9nTlv8WK7\">auto.fix.single</a> = TRUE, <a href=\"http://auto.var\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://auto.var&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792420321233000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1P1EmgSEL3N7Uj7T7vCjZ6\">auto.var</a> = TRUE, <a href=\"http://auto.cov.lv\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://auto.cov.lv&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792420321233000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2TXZAu50emiwudj_MsisUw\">auto.cov.lv</a>.x = TRUE, <a href=\"http://auto.efa\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://auto.efa&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792420321233000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1N7lYVqvPWevPsAWxFmVl7\">auto.efa</a> = TRUE, <a href=\"http://auto.th\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://auto.th&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792420321233000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3wPCgB7ZAHgTWdjQg6lYSX\">auto.th</a> = TRUE, <a href=\"http://auto.delta\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://auto.delta&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792420321233000&amp;usg=AOvVaw09l_pFKYp1Bk08ETyJRMa5\">auto.delta</a> = TRUE, and <a href=\"http://auto.cov\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://auto.cov&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792420321233000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2El5q8EDURl6pdIkaIHji-\">auto.cov</a>.y = TRUE&quot;. <br><br>You can change all or individual default settings by passing your values to the sem function.<br><br><br><br></div>\r\n\r\n \r\n  \r\n  \r\n \r\n <div style=\"word-break:break-word\"><div style=\"line-height:1;padding:0.3em\"><div>Am 04.11.20, 10:15 schrieb Jana F &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">jana...@gmail.com</a>&gt;:</div><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0.8ex 0pt 0pt 0.8ex;border-left:1px solid rgb(204,204,20